f2b0i","WordPress 在恶意发布前拦截 6 个被植入后门的 WP Connect 插件","summary","WordPress 在恶意版本发布前发现并关闭了 WP Connect 开发的 6 个被植入后门的插件，事件被跟踪为 CVE-2026-135202，CVSS 9.8，目前无补丁。","sourceName","The Hacker News","sourceUrl","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/wordpress-blocks-six-backdoored-wp.html","publishedAt","2026-11-25T06:21:12.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"qisjy9p95panczoi5l58gkd5l","DLSS 5 Swapper 官网安装包被替换并投递信息窃取程序","DLSS 5 Swapper 官网分发的 v2.2.9 安装包被同名恶意文件替换，官网公布 SHA-256 为 e89fb5e59b4304e1fb2bccba7d24353ef83ea22b7b699c68a33828ae4420f735。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521528&idx=1&sn=6633daf792ad9501abfb9865bf28cec1","2026-11-25T04:06:00.000Z","axw26ahpt16j5z7des6z6m063","Microsoft 确认 Windows 更新后出现认证问题，CVE-2026-118737 补丁暂无完整修复","Microsoft 确认 Windows Remote Procedure Call Runtime 存在高危远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-118737，未认证攻击者可在无需用户交互的情况下利用尚未安装补丁的系统执行代码。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/microsoft/microsoft-confirms-authentication-issues-after-november-updates/","2026-11-25T09:02:57.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","vhwe2fax4m9ymu05rbldf674y","1Password 员工 GitHub 账号遭入侵，攻击者窃取客户数据","1Password 披露，一名员工的 corporate GitHub 账号被攻破后，攻击者访问私有源码仓库并向后端服务注入恶意代码，下载客户账户记录及内部源码。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/1password-customer-data-stolen-after-employee-github-account-breach/","2026-11-25T21:33:33.000Z","se06jkkvhtyb26dhkzam6bcy6","攻击者利用未撤销密钥入侵 Barracuda 云环境并部署 ARTEX 智能体","Barracuda 报告称，攻击者利用发给第三方 AI 服务提供商且未及时撤销的云访问密钥进入其云环境，活动持续近两天，先后拿下 10 个云环境，其中部分承担 XDR 产品管理职能。","安全客","https://www.anquanke.com/post/id/316541","2026-11-25T03:03:57.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/e78ac72a39cb0522.webp","/dailyinfo/media/7fa058ce21317a21.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/e78ac72a39cb0522.webp 96w","otherSources","kfvyqs51ezpiyu7h7efgz0fzy","InfraTrust 报告基础设施产品供应链漏洞在野利用情况","Eclypsium 11 月 InfraTrust 报告称，10 月 15 日至 11 月 19 日发布的 373 条公告覆盖 3,880 个漏洞，其中 38 条涉及 CISA KEV 漏洞，33 条实际来自 PHP、Node.js、OpenSSH 等第三方捆绑组件。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/infratrust-warns-of-exploited-supply-chain-flaws-in-network-appliances/","2026-11-25T15:00:00.000Z","hqr7a8jnzrlz59l5eel4ijr3d","Com 关联黑客通过 vishing 劫持云账户并窃取数据实施勒索","Palo Alto Networks Unit 42 披露，自 2026 年 8 月以来，多组 Com 关联威胁集群以 vishing 攻击美国、英国和澳大利亚的金融、医疗及法律等行业目标，并通过伪装 IT 人员诱导用户访问个性化钓鱼页面，窃取凭据与会话令牌。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/com-affiliated-hackers-hijack-cloud.html","2026-11-25T06:37:06.000Z",{"_241":321,"_182":-5,"_243":322},{"_241":289,"_182":-5,"_243":290},{"_241":271,"_182":-5,"_243":272},{"_241":254,"_182":-5,"_243":255},{"_241":242,"_182":-5,"_243":244},"label","蓝队与运营","items",[245],{"_179":246,"_56":247,"_182":248,"_184":249,"_186":250,"_188":251,"_190":252,"_192":253,"_194":195,"_196":197},"b33a91bvikjv1n0w4nattkvaw","英国开展国家级排查，数千台制冷控制器被断网","英国近期排查大型超市、仓库、餐厅、加油站和体育场馆的制冷设备风险，期间数千台控制制冷设备的控制器被撤出公网，部分企业改用人工监测温度。Omega Solutions发现风险后，Pen Test Partners完成验证和分析，英国NCSC、Defra、FSA联合推动告警与修复，厂商RDM已发布首批补丁并建议客户采取防护措施。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/96001","2026-11-25T10:20:47.235Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","AI 安全",[256,257],{"_179":266,"_56":267,"_182":268,"_184":207,"_186":269,"_188":270,"_190":210,"_192":211,"_194":195,"_196":197},{"_179":258,"_56":259,"_182":260,"_184":261,"_186":262,"_188":263,"_190":264,"_192":265,"_194":195,"_196":197},"lxnv0a3ecphevlisp1srqqla3","Microsoft Entra Agent ID 凭据注入与钓鱼攻击链分析","文章分析 Microsoft Entra Agent ID 的代理蓝图、蓝图主体、代理身份与代理用户对象，复现凭据注入和管理员钓鱼两条利用链。测试覆盖 79 个资源、1041 项权限，97 项被阻止、944 项仍可通过，并发现可继承权限、跨租户蓝图及 AgentIdentity.CreateAsManager 可用于创建子代理身份和提权。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93443","2026-11-23T12:36:34.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","ok6098ql8nqs69svq8tvt7hwa","Italy 与 Switzerland 报告 AI Agent 驱动的大规模网络攻击","Italy 与 Switzerland 警告 AI Agent 已被用于针对关键基础设施组织的自动化网络攻击。CSIRT Italia 观察到多个 Agent 并行工作，在数小时内入侵大量暴露端点；其中一个 DeepSeek Harness 案例由协调器向 5 个 Agent 分配任务，串联漏洞、配置错误和被盗凭据进入内网，并实时编写恶意代码规避端点防护。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/italy-and-switzerland-warn-of-autonomous-ai-driven-cyberattacks/","2026-11-25T19:39:31.000Z","研究与披露",[273],{"_179":274,"_56":275,"_182":276,"_184":185,"_186":277,"_188":278,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_225":51,"_279":280},"rnegnddxf2wbjfu7xce6rt7o4","Drupal Fail2Install 漏洞 CVE-2026-132165 已在真实站点遭到利用","Drupal Fail2Install 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-132165（CVSS 9.8）已被用于攻击真实站点，CISA 将其纳入 KEV，并要求联邦机构在 2026 年 11 月 27 日前完成修复。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/drupal-fail2install-exploit-details.html","2026-11-25T11:23:26.000Z","related",[281],{"_179":282,"_56":283,"_182":-5,"_184":284,"_186":285,"_188":286,"_190":287,"_192":288,"_194":195,"_196":197},"qi1nz4ggvbuv6km3ay0a86i3c","CISA 将 Idunno AntiCsrf、Drupal Core 和 Optimizely Web Experimentation 漏洞加入 KEV","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/203965/uncategorized/u-s-cisa-adds-drupal-core-idunno-anticsrf-and-optimizely-web-experimentation-flaws-to-its-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog.html","2026-11-25T11:46:54.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[291,292,293,294],{"_179":316,"_56":317,"_182":318,"_184":185,"_186":319,"_188":320,"_190":191,"_192":193,"_194":195,"_196":197},{"_179":311,"_56":312,"_182":313,"_184":284,"_186":314,"_188":315,"_190":287,"_192":288,"_194":195,"_196":197},{"_179":303,"_56":304,"_182":305,"_184":306,"_186":307,"_188":308,"_190":309,"_192":310,"_194":195,"_196":197},{"_179":295,"_56":296,"_182":297,"_184":298,"_186":299,"_188":300,"_190":301,"_192":302,"_194":195,"_196":197},"o7d0b7gcuvubj3yzvzn9qs7xc","VulnCheck：凭据收集占 2026 年漏洞利用请求的 13%","VulnCheck 的 canary network 在 2026 年 1 月至 11 月记录了 694 个被利用 CVE，其中 127 个曾用于搜集数据库密码、云密钥、API token 或 SSH key，占 18%；凭据收集请求占全部漏洞利用记录的 13%，月度占比由 1 月约 1% 升至 9 月和 10 月的 25% 至 35%。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/25/vulncheck-credential-harvesting-exploitat-records/","2026-11-25T06:30:47.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","y2iujer012r6dlq4qwu6j4trf","无密码开放数据库暴露约 20 亿条凭据及会话令牌","Jeremiah Fowler 发现一个可在线访问且无密码、无加密的数据库，其中约有 20 亿条凭据记录、约 8471 个目录和 40 万份疑似由信息窃取木马收集的文档。","Hackread","https://hackread.com/database-exposed-credential-records-session-tokens/","2026-11-25T10:44:20.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/47417cbef4636b7b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp 96w","g8d9n283yuss2oehfy8yjtcgw","瑞士确认首起由 AI Agent 辅助的网络攻击，关键基础设施受影响","瑞士 NCSC 确认其首次收到由 AI Agent 辅助实施的网络攻击报告，至少两个行业的多个组织和关键基础设施运营商受到影响，已知攻击均成功攻陷目标系统。攻击者使用 Agentic Offensive Frameworks，让 Agent 搜索已知漏洞、选择工具、评估结果并决定下一步，主要针对弱口令、软件已知缺陷和互联网暴露系统。","https://securityaffairs.com/204004/hacking/switzerland-confirms-first-ai-agent-cyberattacks-on-local-organisations.html","2026-11-25T21:06:55.000Z","c9hgkghkzefw33iy1l42j3rr8","Hex.pm 遭 CVSS 10.0 漏洞 CVE-2026-129514 在野利用，6 台注册服务器被攻陷","攻击者利用 Hex.pm 的 CVSS 10.0 漏洞 CVE-2026-129514，通过未认证 POST 请求触发系统命令，攻陷 6 台生产服务器；负载均衡日志记录周一 18:16 至 18:29 UTC 期间来自两个地址的 69 次利用请求。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploited-cvss-100-hexpm-rce.html","2026-11-25T09:06:59.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[323,324,325,326],{"_179":146,"_56":132,"_182":351,"_184":352,"_186":353,"_188":354,"_190":-5,"_194":197,"_196":197,"_225":62,"_279":355},{"_179":340,"_56":341,"_182":342,"_184":330,"_186":343,"_188":344,"_190":333,"_192":334,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_225":51,"_279":345},{"_179":335,"_56":336,"_182":337,"_184":207,"_186":338,"_188":339,"_190":210,"_192":211,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_225":49},{"_179":327,"_56":328,"_182":329,"_184":330,"_186":331,"_188":332,"_190":333,"_192":334,"_194":195,"_196":197,"_225":49},"c2wxlv0cccqvf3xrk45i544fa","攻击者利用未修补的 Idunno AntiCsrf 漏洞 CVE-2026-131914 实现 RCE","攻击者正在利用 Idunno AntiCsrf 库中未修补的 CVE-2026-131914，通过不安全反序列化在 IIS worker process 权限下实现 RCE，CVSS 评分为 9.3。","SecurityWeek","https://www.securityweek.com/hackers-exploit-unpatched-flaw-in-defunct-idunno-anticsrf-library/","2026-11-25T09:05:13.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c2a91b85de7bb9d6.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6f21a015ea489b81.webp 96w","ahf6lsd45crjs7phxjmn4d0q3","CISA 警告 Danfoss AK-SM 8xxA 控制器未修复的 RCE 漏洞 CVE-2026-129713","Danfoss AK-SM 8xxA 系列控制器存在 CVE-2026-129713 栈型缓冲区溢出漏洞，CVSS 评分为 9.8，未经认证的攻击者可触发服务器重启，并可能以 Web 服务器权限实现远程代码执行。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/cisa-warns-of-critical-unpatched-flaw-in-danfoss-refrigeration-controllers/","2026-11-25T16:13:40.000Z","avypzdbdq1qojwu816bm9mjpx","Palo Alto Networks 修复已被利用的 PAN-OS Fragnesia 提权漏洞 CVE-2026-46300","Palo Alto Networks 发布 PAN-OS 更新，修复 Linux 内核 Fragnesia 提权漏洞 CVE-2026-46300。该漏洞影响 XFRM ESP-in-TCP 子系统，无权限攻击者可覆写敏感系统文件并获得 root 权限。","https://www.securityweek.com/palo-alto-networks-patches-fragnesia-flaw-used-to-root-firewalls/","2026-11-25T08:12:24.000Z",[346],{"_179":347,"_56":348,"_182":-5,"_184":207,"_186":349,"_188":350,"_190":210,"_192":211,"_194":195,"_196":197},"iihzlri9yx0ljdqwxqduljzdy","Palo Alto Networks 确认 Fragnesia 漏洞 CVE-2026-46300 已用于攻击 PAN-OS 设备","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/palo-alto-networks-warns-of-fragnesia-flaw-exploited-in-pan-os-attacks/","2026-11-25T22:05:09.000Z","GeoServer 未认证远程代码执行漏洞链涉及 CVE-2026-129244、CVE-2026-129243、CVE-2026-120705、CVE-2026-129245 和 CVE-2026-129242，奇安信 CERT 已复现，PoC 和技术细节均已公开。","奇安信 CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508259&idx=1&sn=33a6c21c2746e38d682fa7972dea6c4d","2026-11-24T18:56:00.000Z",[356,357,358],{"_179":368,"_5